SUMMARY:Beginning Granny Square Chickens with Lindsey Alumbaugh\, Day 1
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to make a cute chicken out of only two simple crochet granny squares and a few extra stitches.  This is a beginner level class\, but anyone of any skill level is welcome.  Come knowing nothing about crochet and have a chicken by the end! \nThe workshop will take place over three Saturdays; September 19\, September 26\, & October 3\, 2026.  12-4 PM each day. \nWeek 1:  Learn basic crochet stitches and tension techniques. \nHomework for week 2:  Practice chains and stitches. \nRegister Here \n  \n\n           Download QR
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/beginning-granny-square-chickens-with-lindsey-alumbaugh-day-1
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
