SUMMARY:Beginning Knitting with April Jennings\, Day 1
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, September 20th and Sunday\, September 27th\, 1:00-3:30 pm \nInterested in joining the exciting world of knitting?  In this 2-day course\, you will learn to cast-on\, knit stitch\, purl stitch\, and other skills to create your first knitting project! \nMaterial kit is included in the workshop fee. \nClass limited to 3-6 students. \nRegister Here \n\n           Download QR
